  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $\\alpha, \\beta$ be the roots, then\n$\\begin{aligned}\n&\\alpha^2+\\beta^2=(\\alpha+\\beta)^2-2 \\alpha \\beta \\\\\n&=(a-2)^2+2(a+1) \\\\\n&=a^2-2 a+6 \\\\\n&=(a-1)^2+5 \\geq 5 \\\\\n&\\therefore \\alpha^2+\\beta^2 \\text { is minimum if } a=1 .\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
